![A photography portfolio built with Revela and the Lumina theme](screenshots/example-website.jpg){.browser-mockup}

A personal photography portfolio showcasing landscapes, events, and street photography, built with Revela and the default Lumina theme.

[Visit photo.kirk.one →](https://photo.kirk.one/)

---

## Features Used

| Feature | How It's Used |
|---------|---------------|
| **Lumina Theme** | Default theme with dark design and a native `<dialog>` photo viewer that opens without JavaScript in current browsers |
| **Multiple Galleries** | Organized by year and category (landscapes, events, street) |
| **Nested Categories** | Hierarchical navigation with nested gallery folders |
| **EXIF Statistics** | Statistics page showing camera/lens usage across all photos |
| **OneDrive Sync** | Photos synced from OneDrive shared folder |
| **Custom Sorting** | Galleries sorted by date taken, rating, or filename |
| **Image Optimization** | AVIF, WebP, and JPEG variants with responsive srcset |

## Site Structure

```
source/
├── _images/                    # Shared image pool
├── 01 2024/
│   ├── 01 Landscapes/
│   ├── 02 Events/
│   └── 03 Street/
├── 02 2023/
│   └── ...
├── about/
│   └── _index.revela           # About page (template = "page")
└── stats/
    └── _index.revela           # Statistics (template = "statistics/overview")
```

## Key Configuration

```json
{
  "project": {
    "name": "Kirsten Kluge",
    "baseUrl": "https://photo.kirk.one"
  },
  "theme": {
    "name": "Lumina"
  },
  "generate": {
    "images": {
      "avif": 80,
      "webp": 85,
      "jpg": 90
    },
    "sorting": {
      "galleries": "desc",
      "images": { "field": "dateTaken", "direction": "desc", "fallback": "filename" }
    }
  },
  "plugins": {
    "oneDrive": { "shareUrl": "https://1drv.ms/f/…" },
    "statistics": { "maxEntriesPerCategory": 15, "sortByCount": false }
  }
}
```

Image sizes come from the Lumina theme's defaults; no size configuration is needed.

## What Makes It Interesting

- **Pure photography site**: Revela's core use case, fast and beautiful photo galleries
- **No custom theme needed**: the default Lumina theme handles everything
- **Camera settings with every photo**: aperture, shutter speed, ISO, lens and camera are shown with each photo, read from EXIF
- **Photo viewer without JavaScript**: click any photo for a full-screen view; JavaScript only adds arrow-key navigation and zoom
